"for your auth app of choice:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/mfa.rst:58 783a0c937f1f4a4aa4f91e39ea6e0a11
msgid ""
"**Warning**: in the next session if incorrectly performed, there is the risk "
"of locking yourself out. Before procedding ensure that you have an up-to-"
"date backup."
